{"name":"Secret Story","hex":"#ff1493","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"secret","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A piece of knowledge that is hidden and intended to be kept hidden. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The key or principle by which something is made clear; the knack."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To make or keep secret.","To hide secretly."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/secret"},{"term":"story","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An account of real or fictional events.","A lie, fiction."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To tell as a story; to relate or narrate about.","To post a story (chronological collection of pictures or short videos) on an application or website."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/story"}],"entries":[{"title":"Ramsey Campbell","blocks":[{"text":"Ramsey Campbell is an English horror fiction writer, editor and critic who has been writing for over sixty years. He is the author of over 30 novels and hundreds of short stories, many of them winners of literary awards. Three of his novels have been adapted into films."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Ramsey_Campbell.2.JPG/330px-Ramsey_Campbell.2.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ramsey_Campbell"},{"title":"Secret Story (Portuguese TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Secret Story – Casa dos Segredos is a Portuguese reality competition television show based on the French series Secret Story, and part of the franchise of the same name. The first episode was broadcast on 3 October 2010 on TVI."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/85/Secret_Story_%28Portuguese_TV_series%29_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secret_Story_(Portuguese_TV_series)"},{"title":"Secrecy","blocks":[{"text":"S